# Root-level ignore for this monorepo. web/ and mobile/ each have their own
# .gitignore for their own build/dependency artifacts -- this one exists
# because a stray root-level node_modules/ (e.g. from running a tool at the
# repo root by mistake) had no .gitignore at all covering it, and a leftover
# vitest result file ended up committed as a result.
node_modules/
.DS_Store
*.log
